 ultimate Defender.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock character perks that enhance your unique play-style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your favorite weapons with mods and unique paint jobs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148700/extras/745e15178f6ed9d749b304c2690e69fb.poster.avif?t=1746717706\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148700/extras/745e15178f6ed9d749b304c2690e69fb.webm?t=1746717706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148700/extras/745e15178f6ed9d749b304c2690e69fb.mp4?t=1746717706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modify</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-roll items to achieve the perfect blend of stats to help take down challenging monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials and craft items that can tip the scales and give you an advantage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>End Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the End-Game and earn bounties packed with bonus XP while you hunt for the rarest loot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148700/extras/74076f6cde88b1f1278db00eb55c4a54.poster.avif?t=1746717706\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148700/extras/74076f6cde88b1f1278db00eb55c4a54.webm?t=1746717706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148700/extras/74076f6cde8